+    solver: "PROGRAM-EDITOR mechanic (fully RE'd 2026-06-17). The object runs a 5-slot MOVE-PROGRAM (vkuvtkaerv); each slot holds a command code (tn36.py:2171 okllwtboml: 0=settle,1=left,2=right,3=down,5/6/7/16=rotate,8/9=scale+/-,14/15/63=property,33=up). Step size CSPOIQWER=4. EDIT a slot by clicking its TWO bit-buttons at (slotX, y=41) and (slotX, y=44): button1=+1, button2=+2, BOTH set -> code 3 (down). Slot X centers ~ {0:19,1:24,2:31,3:34,4:39}. RUN the program by clicking the object sub-button sxhtkytekm (~36,55). L1 solve: edit slots 1,3,4 to code 3 -> program [3,3,3,3,3] = 5 downs x4 = +20y -> y:13->33 = win. 7 clicks total."
